The Italian, Polish, Russian and Simplified Chinese strings in
src/AudioCpp.Bindings.Gui/Resources/Strings.{it,pl,ru,zh}.resx are taken
verbatim from that project's web UI language files
(webui/native/lang/lang_<code>.json), for the keys this application shares
with it. They are imported, unmodified, by
tools/locales/import_webui_locales.py; the importer refuses to run if the
English text behind a shared key has diverged.

English strings for keys shared with that project also follow its wording, for
the same reason.
